    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873010/extras/8071d740b42a752f52301f8fd6fa3558.avif?t=1729765402\" data-has-big width=800 height=390 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2665\u2665\u2665You Can Actually Touch Miyuki from the Original Novel?! \u2665\u2665\u2665</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 12,000,000 views!The original &quot;How to Ruin a Romantic Comedy&quot; from Novelpia has been brought to life!Summer beaches, festivals... even bathing together?!Experience intimate moments with Miyuki in the world of the game!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > \u2665\u2665\u2665Story\u2665\u2665\u2665</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, I got reincarnated as the delinquent 'Matsuda' in a romantic comedy game!The heroine, 'Hanazawa Miyuki', with a cute face and a voluptuous figure...After saving her from a dangerous situation, she says she wants to repay me?This is a great chance! I'll make sure she can't live without me!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > \u2665\u2665\u2665Game Features\u2665\u2665\u2665</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced by professional voice actors<br>- Miyuki CV(JP) : Monaca Morino<br>- Miyuki CV(KO) : Jimin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intimate dating experience<br>- 6 episodes<br>- 4 interactive touch mini-games</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873010/extras/ab9269a0c5651a0e189ab92c97446384.avif?t=1729765402\" width=616 height=291 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873010/extras/bd08fff521716b223398b645253f3c08.avif?t=1729765402\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873010/extras/21f8eafc39f3eaeb14c7cb6c9a21bc2d.avif?t=1729765402\" width=616 height=289 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u24d2Songasonga / Novelpia Ltd.  <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873010/extras/8071d740b42a752f52301f8fd6fa3558.avif?t=1729765402\" data-has-big width=800 height=390 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2665\u2665\u2665You Can Actually Touch Miyuki from the Original Novel?! \u2665\u2665\u2665</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 12,000,000 views!The original &quot;How to Ruin a Romantic Comedy&quot; from Novelpia has been brought to life!Summer beaches, festivals... even bathing together?!Experience intimate moments with Miyuki in the world of the game!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > \u2665\u2665\u2665Story\u2665\u2665\u2665</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, I got reincarnated as the delinquent 'Matsuda' in a romantic comedy game!The heroine, 'Hanazawa Miyuki', with a cute face and a voluptuous figure...After saving her from a dangerous situation, she says she wants to repay me?This is a great chance! I'll make sure she can't live without me!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > \u2665\u2665\u2665Game Features\u2665\u2665\u2665</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced by professional voice actors<br>- Miyuki CV(JP) : Monaca Morino<br>- Miyuki CV(KO) : Jimin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intimate dating experience<br>- 6 episodes<br>- 4 interactive touch mini-games</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873010/extras/ab9269a0c5651a0e189ab92c97446384.avif?t=1729765402\" width=616 height=291 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873010/extras/bd08fff521716b223398b645253f3c08.avif?t=1729765402\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"